      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design rate limiter",
      "fontSize": 60.6992795596016,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design rate limiter",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hs2rZWUva2cVjE5bda-Vb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40217.47931432453,
      "y": -16519.122996850198,
      "width": 1495.5115966796875,
      "height": 585,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 543776257,
      "version": 217,
      "versionNonce": 327175649,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776272554344,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "limits req sent by particular user in given interval of time\n\nex: 2 req per person in 10 second\nif 3rd comes then it return 429 status code (Too many request)\n\n\n1 - Prevent Overloading: \n    Can overwhelm a system, causing it to either crash or maybe perform poorly\n2 - Ensure Fair Usage: \n    One user sending too many requests can block other users from using the service.\n3 - Control Costs:\n    More requests mean more processing power\n    Restricting excessive usage",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "limits req sent by particular user in given interval of time\n\nex: 2 req per person in 10 second\nif 3rd comes then it return 429 status code (Too many request)\n\n\n1 - Prevent Overloading: \n    Can overwhelm a system, causing it to either crash or maybe perform poorly\n2 - Ensure Fair Usage: \n    One user sending too many requests can block other users from using the service.\n3 - Control Costs:\n    More requests mean more processing power\n    Restricting excessive usage",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "166hKhdEaNo6VYSmNFHGi",
