      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776275985906,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 3: Placement of rate limiter",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 3: Placement of rate limiter",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xlBQBKahbKBry2Q7itLpV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40202.051289561125,
      "y": -15667.057090876317,
      "width": 1351.11572265625,
      "height": 585,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1536524705,
      "version": 145,
      "versionNonce": 2089366860,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778187126206,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional \n\n- User usage restriction\n    - Based on IP address\n        We can restrict each unique IP address to just 100 requests / minute\n    - Based on User ID\n        User 123 is allowed just 50 requests / hour\n    - Based on DeviceID \n        limiting each unique device to just 500 requests / day\n\n\n- User Notification\n    Notify user if it exceeds quota",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional \n\n- User usage restriction\n    - Based on IP address\n        We can restrict each unique IP address to just 100 requests / minute\n    - Based on User ID\n        User 123 is allowed just 50 requests / hour\n    - Based on DeviceID \n        limiting each unique device to just 500 requests / day\n\n\n- User Notification\n    Notify user if it exceeds quota",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tf6J_HAbPWfAx5Mw6S4pK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -38673.569820925986,
      "y": -15666.378183755527,
      "width": 745.7756958007812,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 256619759,
      "version": 250,
      "versionNonce": 1918069580,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778187107019,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non functional Requirements\n\nscale: 1M rps\nHighly available : 99.99999% (7 9's)\nLow latency : ultra low : <5 ms per request",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non functional Requirements\n\nscale: 1M rps\nHighly available : 99.99999% (7 9's)\nLow latency : ultra low : <5 ms per request",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "m9SuiP9cD8A4KG3jlDVGt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40182.40895291063,
      "y": -14847.76770749883,
      "width": 1628.927978515625,
      "height": 1035,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 641030383,
      "version": 1034,
      "versionNonce": 371248929,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776277798298,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DAU : assume 500M users\n\nMAU: assume 2B users\n\nThroughput: \n    assume each users makes 100 req/day\n    total req / day = 500M * 100 = 50B req / day\n\n    QPS : 50B / 100k    =   50M / 100  =  500K req / sec\n\n    assume app supports 50 different types of apis\n\nStorage: \n    we need to store user id, request type and count = assume 100 byte per row\n    we supports 500M  DAU * 50 types * 100 byte    =     2500000 MB  =    2.5TB\n    we can store this 2.5TB data in cache. since its relatively small size\n\nNetwork bandwidth\n    assume each req and res has avg size of 1kb\n    \n    total data trasfer per day = 50B * 1kb   =   50TB / day\n    \n    total data trasfer per second = 50 TB / 100k    =      50 GB / 100    =    0.5GB / sec",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DAU : assume 500M users\n\nMAU: assume 2B users\n\nThroughput: \n    assume each users makes 100 req/day\n    total req / day = 500M * 100 = 50B req / day\n\n    QPS : 50B / 100k    =   50M / 100  =  500K req / sec\n\n    assume app supports 50 different types of apis\n\nStorage: \n    we need to store user id, request type and count = assume 100 byte per row\n    we supports 500M  DAU * 50 types * 100 byte    =     2500000 MB  =    2.5TB\n    we can store this 2.5TB data in cache. since its relatively small size\n\nNetwork bandwidth\n    assume each req and res has avg size of 1kb\n    \n    total data trasfer per day = 50B * 1kb   =   50TB / day\n    \n    total data trasfer per second = 50 TB / 100k    =      50 GB / 100    =    0.5GB / sec",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
