    {
      "id": "ocpSQWSQcEM7CSGdRRcXq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -39946.23531990943,
      "y": -7119.288575951012,
      "width": 1040.111572265625,
      "height": 765,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1810972655,
      "version": 269,
      "versionNonce": 1173503201,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776278870254,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Token Bucket\n\n    Tokens are added at a fixed rate, each request uses 1 token.\n    \n    Example:\n    \n    Bucket size = 5 tokens\n    Refill = 3 tokens / sec\n    \n    add explanation\n\n\n    \n    Good for handling bursts\n\n    but issue is hard to come up with appropriate bucket size and \n    refill rate",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Token Bucket\n\n    Tokens are added at a fixed rate, each request uses 1 token.\n    \n    Example:\n    \n    Bucket size = 5 tokens\n    Refill = 3 tokens / sec\n    \n    add explanation\n\n\n    \n    Good for handling bursts\n\n    but issue is hard to come up with appropriate bucket size and \n    refill rate",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0DwwzbivsnKk28yiipwzX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -38772.55866395625,
      "y": -7119.015213381247,
      "width": 1067.003662109375,
      "height": 855,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1184895599,
      "version": 430,
      "versionNonce": 1085714127,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776278839090,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Leaky Bucket\n\n    Requests are processed at a fixed rate (like water leaking).\n    \n    Example:\n    \n    Queue fills with requests\n    System processes 3 req/sec only\n    Extra requests are dropped if queue is full\n\n    add explanation\n\n    \n    Good for smooth, constant traffic\n\n    but issue is it cant handle peak traffic at once it starts dropping \n    legitimate request\n\n    on top of that it increases latency due to waiting in queue",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Leaky Bucket\n\n    Requests are processed at a fixed rate (like water leaking).\n    \n    Example:\n    \n    Queue fills with requests\n    System processes 3 req/sec only\n    Extra requests are dropped if queue is full\n\n    add explanation\n\n    \n    Good for smooth, constant traffic\n\n    but issue is it cant handle peak traffic at once it starts dropping \n    legitimate request\n\n    on top of that it increases latency due to waiting in queue",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
