      "updated": 1776281149449,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. Sliding Window Counter\n\n    Hybrid of fixed window + sliding window.\n        \n    Good:\n    Fixes edge issue of fixed window\n    Uses less memory than sliding log\n    \n    Issue:\n    Slightly less accurate than sliding log (approximation)\n    \n    Balanced approach\n    Best choice in interviews",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. Sliding Window Counter\n\n    Hybrid of fixed window + sliding window.\n        \n    Good:\n    Fixes edge issue of fixed window\n    Uses less memory than sliding log\n    \n    Issue:\n    Slightly less accurate than sliding log (approximation)\n    \n    Balanced approach\n    Best choice in interviews",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
